    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 18</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XVI} Gif hwa nunnan mid hæmeðþinge oððe on hire hrægl oððe on hire breost butan hire leaf gefó, sie hit twybete swa we ær be læwdum men fundon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone seizes a nun with carnal intent either on her clothing or on her breast without her permission, let the compensation be twice what we earlier set for lay[wo]men.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone lustfully seizes a nun, either by her clothes or by her breast, without her permission, he shall pay as recompense twice the sum we have fixed in the case of a woman belonging to the laity.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XVI. Gif hwa nunnan mid hæmeþðinge oððe on hire hrægl oððe on hire breost butan hire leaf gefó, sie hit twybete swa we ær be lewdum men fundon.</ab>
      </div>
